message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. Licence and release details are being finalised by the authors."
title: "CyberNCM: a single-site, behaviour-based network detector and its negative results (research prototype)"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Rohan"
    family-names: "Sai"
  - given-names: "Yuvashree"
    family-names: "C"
  - given-names: "Sonia"
    family-names: "C"
abstract: >
  A research prototype that learns one site's normal network behaviour from flow records and flags
  unusual source addresses, with a record of every research round including negative and incomplete ones.
  Not a production security system.
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - anomaly detection
  - network security
  - research prototype
